@startuml AirWatch_CO_End_To_End_Pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFE
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 18
skinparam ArrowColor #0369A1
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam Padding 6

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #E0F2FE
  BorderColor #0284C7
  FontColor #0F172A
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  DiamondBorderColor #D97706
  StartColor #0284C7
  EndColor #0F172A
  BarColor #0369A1
}

title <b>AirWatch CO — End-to-End Project Pipeline</b>\nUCI hourly air quality → next-hour CO prediction → live dashboard

start
:<<data>> **UCI Air Quality Dataset**\nItalian roadside station · Mar 2004–Apr 2005\nHourly weather + sensors + pollutants;
:<<process>> **Preprocessing**\nParse European CSV · replace **-200 → NaN**\nDrop NMHC(GT) · time-aware impute · build **CO_next**;
:<<explore>> **EDA & Business Statistics**\nDiurnal / weekly patterns · IQR outliers\nHistogram + normal overlay · probabilities;
:<<model>> **Chronological modelling**\n70% / 15% / 15% time split\nBaseline · Linear · Ridge · RF · Tuned HGB;
:<<eval>> **Holdout evaluation**\nRMSE ↓ · MAE ↓ · R² ↑\nChampion: **Tuned HistGradientBoosting**;
:<<serve>> **Artifacts + API + Dashboard**\nmodel.joblib · metrics.json\nFastAPI (Render) · React UI (Vercel);
stop

legend right
  |= Stage |= Meaning |
  | Data | Raw UCI telemetry |
  | Process | Cleaning & target |
  | Explore | Patterns & stats |
  | Model | Time-aware ML |
  | Eval | Honest holdout |
  | Serve | Live demo system |
endlegend

@enduml
